      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">During the project life the EOP target had been overachieved (e.g. 41,000 ha in 2010), but because of the annual nature of most ofFONAFIFO&#x2019;s budget and the five-year length of most of its conservation contracts, Costa Rica&apos;s PSA program is subject to widefluctuations in the areas under conservation.</narrative>
